# v0.5.4-docs: aggressive minimal public tree — internal docs (local-only)
# Public indispensable for forker/cloner: README.md, LICENSE*, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock,
# src/, .github/workflows/*, packaging/install.sh, SECURITY.md, CONTRIBUTING.md,
# ARCHITECTURE.md, BENCHMARK.md, THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES — everything else below is hidden
# from published minimal view (CHANGELOG is internal; kept in git history but not in
# published minimal tarball — forker sees Releases page).
/CHANGELOG.md
# BENCHMARK.md stays public (linked from README Benchmarks at a glance + GOVERNANCE);
# do not re-add /BENCHMARK.md here — see Gate 1 B2 Option A.
# Uncomment to make stricter minimal (currently kept public for README links + Scorecard):
# /ARCHITECTURE.md
# /GOVERNANCE.md
# /RELEASING.md
# /CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md

# Aggressive hidden: ignore dotfiles/dirs at repository root only (scoped)
# `.*` matched at any level and silenced .gitattributes/.env in subdirs — scoping to
# `/.??*` keeps the minimal-forker intent but avoids silencing nested dotfiles.
/.??*
# Minimal public hidden exceptions (must stay visible to forker/cloner)
!.github/
!.github/**
!.gitignore
!.ignore
!.gitattributes
# Keep tracked hidden plugins for marketplace/CI (defensive re-include)
!.claude-plugin/
!.claude-plugin/**
!.ci/
!.ci/**
